{
    "title": "PinaDate - Filipino Dating App",
    "description": "Experience PinaDate, one of the most popular dating apps for mature people brimming with an active online community of Filipino singles ready to chat, meet, and find love. This feature-rich dating app guarantees an exciting journey in the realm of online dating.\r\nPinaDate provides a sleek platform to meet single women and men from the Philippines. Seize your opportunity to redefine your dating experiences, make friends, or possibly find your girlfriend or boyfriend. Direct your life towards thrilling new experiences.\r\n\r\nPinaDate's potential is boundless:\r\n\r\nBROADEN YOUR HORIZONS\r\nConnect with singles searching for companionship. Your options to find friends or love in the Philippines are vast, whether you're exploring the country or enjoying Asian dating online from home.\r\n\r\nDISCOVER YOUR DESIRES\r\nGet exactly what you're looking for, be it friends, serious relationships, flirtatious chats, or a blend of it all. Our diverse features ensure there's something for everyone on PinaDate!\r\n\r\nEXPERIENCE UNIQUE DATING\r\nOur platform offers an unparalleled set of online dating features that stand out in the realm of Asian dating. We introduce a live dating feature \u2013 video chat! \r\n\r\nALL-IN-ONE DATING APP\r\n\u2022 Enjoy free registration and access one of the top dating apps.\r\n\u2022 Customize your search for a virtual date.\r\n\u2022 View captivating profiles and high-quality photos of single girls and guys.\r\n\u2022 Get notifications when someone messages you.\r\n\u2022 Opt for subscription to enjoy premium features: access private photos & videos, chat in real-time, use offline messages, videochat, swap photos, send stickers and animated smilies, and try our Let\u2019s Mingle feature.\r\n\r\nSECURE DATING ENVIRONMENT\r\nWe prioritize traditional dating, privacy protection, and member verification. Our AI-powered moderation system safeguards our community 24/7, making us a trusted dating site.\r\n\r\n\u2665\ufe0f PinaDate \u2013 COMMITTED TO YOUR JOURNEY\r\nFeel the freedom and flexibility to meet new people anywhere with PinaDate. Our purpose-driven technology makes love happen in innovative ways. We match a lot of members online daily.\r\n\r\nIMPORTANT SUBSCRIPTION DETAILS\r\n\u2022 Subscribe to chat and interact with other members through our dating app.\r\n\u2022 Choose from one of our three excellent subscription packages to unlock premium features \u2013 150 Credits/month ($29.99 for the 1st month, then $69.99/month); 400 Credits/month ($142.99); and 950 Credits/month ($269.99).\r\n\u2022 Your Google Play account will be charged upon confirmation of your purchase.\r\n\u2022 Your subscription will auto-renew unless you cancel at least 24-hours before the end of your current subscription period.\r\n\u2022 Auto-renewal can be turned off by going to your Google Play account settings after purchase.\r\n\r\nTerms and conditions: https://www.pinadate.com/en/terms-and-conditions/\r\nPrivacy policy: https://www.pinadate.com/en/policy/",
